    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 DQ-05: across 4 languages, test-coverage has 100% precision but ~20% recall (80% of actually-tested functions reported untested). Misses framework dispatch (Spring MockMvc, Kotlin PSI visitor, Go YAML reflection). The tool correctly notes it is static-only, but the limitation is severe enough to warrant prominent documentation in `--help`, README, and any 'untested' output header. Add per-language caveat lines listing known dispatch blind spots."  # 858c
