  message: "Fixed in commit 2846f4a17. test-coverage now emits per-language false-negative caveats in text output (footer), JSON output (caveats field), and --help epilog. Recall_disclaimer + per_language entries for Java/Spring/MockMvc, Kotlin/PSI, Go/reflection, Scala/ScalaTest, Ruby/RSpec, Python/pytest, JS-TS/Jest, C#/xUnit. Languages without documented blind spots silently skip caveats. 6 new tests cover all surfaces."  # 6682
